This product includes material from Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup
(https://github.com/crawl/crawl), copyright the DCSS devteam and contributors,
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later:

  - Game Knowledge extracted from crawl source (monster, spell, item, god and
    species data, and description text). Each Game Knowledge bundle records
    the crawl tag or commit it was extracted from.
  - Combat, spell and related formulas ported from crawl source.

DCSS tile art: the monster tiles in app/static/tiles are from crawl's rltiles
(crawl-ref/source/rltiles at the tag each Game Knowledge bundle records), the
work of DCSS's tile artists (https://github.com/crawl/tiles/blob/master/ARTISTS.md).
Some tiles are based on the public domain RLTiles tileset
(http://rltiles.sf.net).

  - Most of them are released under CC0 1.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
  - The rest, those crawl's tile project lists as under an unknown license,
    from NetHack, or not agreed by their artist (TILES_UNDER_UNKNOWN_LICENSE.md
    in https://github.com/crawl/tiles), are not released under CC0. They ship
    as part of Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup, copyright the DCSS devteam and
    contributors, under crawl's GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.

As crawl's tile build does, the tiles crawl's tile lists outline (%rim 1) are
shipped with a one-pixel black outline added; the tiles are otherwise unchanged.
